OL,5,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,7,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,8,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,9,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,10,     Feverything in between.
OL,11,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,12,     FSoweto's guest this week is East
OL,13,     FLondon born, Nottingham-based
OL,14,     Fsinger Yazmin Lacey.
OL,15,G0030 Through the Night
OL,16,     FPianist Mario Alonso Herrero
OL,17,     Fdelivers a compelling performance
OL,18,     Fof Prokofiev's second piano
OL,19,     Fconcerto with the Shanghai
OL,20,     FPhilharmonic Orchestra and
OL,21,     Fconductor Zhang Liang.
